<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Fleming cut to hold.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Fleming cut to hold.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- CS First Boston said it raised its rating on Fleming Cos Inc to hold from sell.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 5/8 to 17-7/8 in early New York Stock Exchange trade.</p>
</text>
